## Slide 8

Charting Options

Processing and Visualization of Sample Sub-Groups are done independently. Any SPC chart can be used with any SPC data, based upon the desired result. 
Below are examples of the different, specialized SPC Charts available in TrakSYS…

Paired SPC Charts [ Xbar-R, X-Bar-S, and I-M ]

Moving Average Charts [ Individual, Weighted, and Exponential Weighted ]

Histogram Chart

