## Slide 10

Charting Options

Compared to the standard Charts, each SPC chart has an extended set of properties to allow for more significant control over the visualization.
SPC Charting Properties include…
Hide/Show Sigma Bands
Auto-Calculate or Set Control Limits
Visualization Settings for all Limits
Special Data Visualization for Groups with Violations
Special On-Click Overrides for Groups with Violations
And more…

In this next example, the Task has processing applied after  being saved as part of a Task Definition Script Class.  The result is being saved as part of the Task record, as both the PassFail state and the User State for later visualization. 

